{"id":16955,"name":"Summit County","slug":"summit-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/summit-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:15","facts":{"typicalSaleDate":"End of October annually","redemptionPeriod":"1 year by Redemption Payment Plan","interestRate":"18%","bidProcedure":"Bid Down (lowest interest rate wins)","deposit":"$500 registration fee","extra":[{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Summit County Fiscal Office"},{"label":"County Website","value":"County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"n1gheW30dwkHaJEPl68UXTN5BqtQbxzmj4KvRMFCicf7rOYIoDGAVypuZ\"><iframe title=\"18% ROI Your Ticket to Success - Summit County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gea7EgN-kuI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"18%-ROI:-Your-Ticket-to-Success-with-Summit-County-Tax-Lien-&amp;-Deed-Investing\">18% ROI: Your Ticket to Success with Summit County Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Summit County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>, offers a unique opportunity for investors through tax lien certificates and tax deed sales. These investment options can provide high returns and allow you to acquire properties at a fraction of their market value. Here’s a guide to get you started.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Overview-of-Tax-Lien-Certificates-and-Tax-Deeds\">Overview of Tax Lien Certificates and Tax Deeds in Summit County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Lien Certificates</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You purchase a lien on a delinquent property, not the property itself.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The lien accrues simple annual interest, which is recalculated monthly.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>If the property owner fails to pay their taxes, you earn interest until the lien is redeemed.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Typical interest rate: 18%.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Deed Sales</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You bid to purchase the property itself.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bidding starts at two-thirds of the property&#8217;s appraised value.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Requires a minimum deposit of $1,000.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Investing-in-Summit-County\">Steps to Start Investing in Summit County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Knowing the legal framework is crucial.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check the specific regulations for tax lien and tax deed sales in Summit County.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Summit County Fiscal Office Website</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Find detailed information on tax lien certificates: <a href=\"https://fiscaloffice.summitoh.net/index.php/tax-certificate-liens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Summit County Tax Certificate Liens</mark></a>​.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Look up tax deed sales info: <a href=\"https://sheriff.summitoh.net/pages/Sheriff-Sales-Information.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Summit County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a>​.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Auctions for tax deeds are conducted online via RealAuction: <a href=\"https://summit.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Summit County Delinquent Taxes Sale Auction Site</mark></a>​.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Details About Tax Liens and Deeds</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ensure you know the sale schedule, parcel inquiry details, and other essential information.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For additional inquiries, contact the Summit County Fiscal Office at 330-643-2600.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse-.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse-.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse-.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Summit-County-Ohio-Courthouse--32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-16961 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Summit County, Ohio Courthouse \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Ensure you fully understand the property and its current state.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Budget for Additional Costs</strong>: Prepare to cover potential additional costs, such as back taxes or liens.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register Early</strong>: Registration is mandatory to participate in auctions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Check for Meth Lab Locations</strong>: The Sheriff’s website notes properties previously used for illegal activities.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>County Tax Certificate Liens: <a href=\"https://fiscaloffice.summitoh.net/index.php/tax-certificate-liens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Link</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>County Tax Deed Sales Information: <a href=\"https://sheriff.summitoh.net/pages/Sheriff-Sales-Information.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Link</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>County Delinquent Taxes Sale Auction Site: <a href=\"https://summit.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Link</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for an auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You can register on the Summit County Fiscal Office website or RealAuction site. Ensure you pay the registration fee in advance.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You will receive your investment back plus the accrued interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Do tax deed purchases involve any additional costs?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Yes, there might be additional costs, such as back taxes or liens, so research thoroughly before bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How can I avoid foreclosure on my property due to unpaid taxes?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Enter into a payment plan with the Delinquent Tax Department to avoid a tax lien sale and foreclosure​.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to explore investment opportunities in Summit County? Dive into the world of tax lien and tax deed investing and unlock potential high returns with minimal upfront costs. Want to learn more? <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a> with us or access our <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">FREE resources</mark></a>. Happy investing!</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for F